The '''fang''' is an item that is dropped by [[Zebak]] in the [[Tombs of Amascut]], in which the player receives one if they dealt the most damage to him.

It is buried on the island with a [[spade]] in the middle of the [[River Elid]] (where players acquired the [[Lily of the Elid]] during [[Beneath Cursed Sands]]) after having spoken to the [[Bank Camel]], as part of obtaining the [[Ancient key (Tombs of Amascut)|ancient key]] from them. Doing so requires having completed the [[miniquest]] [[Into the Tombs]].

